      "reasons": [
        "The packet only describes a categorization of measures used for evaluating *food-evoked emotions*, not a generally defined “broad type of method used to assess a psychological response or process.”",
        "The definition’s framing (“whether emotions are measured through physiological signals, behavioral responses, or cognitive self-report methods”) is only partially supported: the packet lists measurement level categories as physiological, behavioral, and cognitive, but does not specify “physiological signals” or explicitly equate “cognitive” with “ratings and questionnaires.”"
